/style><table class=\"infobox hrecipe adr\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-above\">軟糖</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Candy.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Candy.jpg/250px-Candy.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Candy.jpg/500px-Candy.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1200\" /></a></span><div class=\"infobox-caption\" style=\"padding-bottom:0.25em;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;\">市場上的各類軟糖</div></td></tr><tr class=\"note\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">別稱</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\">橡皮糖</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">類型</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A4%9C%E5%AD%90\" title=\"餜子\">餜子</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">起源地</th><td class=\"infobox-data region\" style=\"\">德國</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">發明者</th><td class=\"infobox-data author\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%A2%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E9%BB%8E%E6%A0%BC\" title=\"漢斯·黎格\">漢斯·黎格</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">主要成分</th><td class=\"infobox-data ingredient\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%9A%E7%B3%96%E8%83%B6\" title=\"多糖膠\">多糖膠</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E8%83%B6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"明膠\">明膠</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">菜品變種</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BD%AF%E7%B3%96%E7%86%8A\" title=\"軟糖熊\">軟糖熊</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>軟糖</b>又名<b>橡皮糖</b>，是一種較柔軟且微有<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%B9%E6%80%A7\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"彈性\">彈性</a>的膠狀<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"糖果\">糖果</a>，主要成份為<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%9A%E7%B3%96%E8%83%B6\" title=\"多糖膠\">多糖膠</a>（如<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9E%9C%E8%83%B6\" title=\"果膠\">果膠</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E6%8B%89%E8%83%B6\" title=\"卡拉膠\">卡拉膠</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%90%BC%E8%84%82\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"瓊脂\">瓊脂</a>）或<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E8%83%B6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"明膠\">明膠</a>，多為<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%8A%E9%80%8F%E6%98%8E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"半透明\">半透明</a>。大部分軟糖的含水量較高，且多為<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"水果\">水果</a>味，其形狀也因不同的種類和需要而製成各種形狀。這類糖果起源於<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BE%B7%E5%9B%BD\" title=\"德國\">德國</a>的<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BD%AF%E7%B3%96%E7%86%8A\" title=\"軟糖熊\">軟糖熊</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gummy_bears.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Gummy_bears.jpg/250px-Gummy_bears.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Gummy_bears.jpg/500px-Gummy_bears.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1800\" data-file-height=\"1350\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%93%88%E7%91%9E%E5%AF%B6\" title=\"哈瑞寶\">哈瑞寶</a>公司的<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BD%AF%E7%B3%96%E7%86%8A\" title=\"軟糖熊\">軟糖熊</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fruit_flavoured_gumdrops.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Fruit_flavoured_gumdrops.JPG/250px-Fruit_flavoured_gumdrops.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"236\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Fruit_flavoured_gumdrops.JPG/500px-Fruit_flavoured_gumdrops.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2043\" data-file-height=\"1931\" /></a><figcaption>撒上糖粉的軟糖</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考文献\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8C.AE\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%BD%AF%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-r